Description:
    This file-only package provides district boundaries by censal years for use with 
    the tidycensuskr package. It contains spatial boundary data (sf objects)
    for South Korean administrative districts (ADM2) and neighborhoods (ADM3) from
    census years 2010, 2015, 2020, and 2025.
